        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "invoice-agent v1.1 deploy at t=471 introduced an inverted VAT multiplier bug, writing incorrect VAT/total into the invoices table from t=487 onward; sync-job copied these bad values into ledger, causing 9 I3_ledger_integrity violations."
}
